# cysteamine.msf
# 2-Aminoethanethiol (cysteamine)
# pKa1=8.270 (SH → S-, q=+1→0)  pKa2=10.750 (NH3+ → NH2, q=0→-1)
# Source: Perrin 1981
# Simplest thiol-amine. Isolates the mutual inductive effects of NH3+/NH2
# on the adjacent SH acid. Directly addresses the cluster of negative
# residuals in alpha-thiol amino acids (homocysteine, cysteine, penicillamine,
# thiolactic_acid, thioglycolic_acid, 3_mercaptopropionic_acid).

